   "kind": "dark",
   "title": "A first seizure: HISTORY is the key",
   "lines": [
    "details of the event · witnesses · ambulance records · risk factors: febrile seizures, head trauma, meningitis or encephalitis, family history",
    "URGENT evaluation if fever, trauma, enduring confusion or low consciousness, or a persistent focal deficit"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "g_ne",
