   "w": 440,
   "h": 114,
   "kind": "info",
   "title": "Work up to estimate the RECURRENCE RISK",
   "lines": [
    "1 · electrolytes (extended) · CT in the emergency department: bleed, tumour?",
    "2 · MRI, epilepsy protocol: a STRUCTURAL lesion ↑ risk",
    "3 · EEG: EPILEPTIFORM discharges ↑ risk"
   ]
  },
